  "narration": {
    "beats": [
      {
        "id": "b1",
        "text": "Let's sum up what we discovered.",
        "at": 0
      },
      {
        "id": "b2",
        "text": "An object in a fluid pushes some of the fluid **aside**.",
        "at": 4
      },
      {
        "id": "b3",
        "text": "The fluid pushes back up with the **buoyant force**, equal to the weight of the fluid pushed aside.",
        "at": 9.5
      },
      {
        "id": "b4",
        "text": "If that push can match the object's weight, it **floats**. If not, it **sinks**.",
        "at": 16
      },
      {
        "id": "b5",
        "text": "That's why a huge steel ship floats: its hollow shape pushes aside a lot of water!",
        "at": 21
      }
    ]
  },
